{"pin":"BH00072","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00072","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be to God Who hath uttered a word in the world, and the peoples differed as to its meaning. Among them were those who recognized [3.5s]... ...O Zayn! Such souls as comply with the injunction of God prescribed in the Book are regarded as most excellent in the same estimation of God… O Thou Who art the Lord of all names! I beseech Thee by Thy Name which overshadoweth all things","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله الذی نطق بکلمه فی العالم و اختلفت الاحزاب فی معناها منهم من عرف  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"5020","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15717.001","source":"BLIB_Or15717","locator":"001"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA45:182","source":"INBA45","locator":"182","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v045/?page=184"},{"kind":"music","code":"E. Tarani","source":"E","locator":"Tarani","url":"https://youtu.be/YBnkP4MCGIM"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#115 p.204x","source":"ADM2","locator":"115 p.204x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=204"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AYI2.160x","source":"AYI2","locator":"160x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AI2/ai2-146.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_HUQUQP#007x","source":"BRL_HUQUQP","locator":"007x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/257249741"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MSBH5.454ax","source":"MSBH5","locator":"454ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/sulaymani_masabih-i-hidayat_vol_5"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YIA.191x","source":"YIA","locator":"191x","url":"https://adibmasumian.files.wordpress.com/2021/01/yia.pdf#page=187"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#116","source":"ADMS","locator":"116","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bh00072_prayer_for_departed/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_HUQUQ#007x","source":"BRL_HUQUQ","locator":"007x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/461091298"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#1103x","source":"COC","locator":"1103x"}]},